let __v_721 = Value::from(" Do the 48-hour patch test, then work on dry, unwashed hair in sections: roots first, and pull the colour through the ends for the last ten minutes only, so they are not done twice. Time it by the box rather than by eye, rinse in cool water until it runs clear, then condition. Wash it less often and cooler with a colour-safe shampoo to keep the shade from fading.");
