let __v_759 = Value::from("It will grow out: a bad cut stops being noticeable in two to three weeks, and until then it needs one small, even trim rather than a rescue at home. Go back within a week and say plainly which part you do not like - most salons and barbers put a cut right for free, and you can ask for a different stylist. A fringe that went too short is three weeks of wearing it to the side with a pin. Take a photo today, because that is what a refund or a free correction rests on if they will not have it back.");
